    "progressSummary": "COMPLETED: Tendsto ω atTop (nhds 0) proved in AreaOfCircleOQ01OQ02OQ01OQ01OQ01.lean. 0 sorries, 0 axioms.",
    "builtItems": [
      "omega_even_formula: ω(2k) = π^k/k! proved by induction (AreaOfCircleOQ01OQ02OQ01OQ01OQ01.lean:37-47)",
      "omega_odd_le_two_even: ω(2k+1) ≤ 2·ω(2k) proved by induction (lines 56-82)",
      "omega_le_two_even_half: ω(n) ≤ 2·ω(2·(n/2)) for all n (lines 89-95)",
      "omega_tendsto_zero: main theorem via squeeze (lines 105-131)"
    ],
    "insights": [
      "ω(2k) = π^k/k! exactly — these are the terms of e^π, hence → 0 from summability",
      "Odd bound: 4π/(2k+3) ≤ 4π/(2k+2) since 2k+3 ≥ 2k+2 — the induction step is pure arithmetic",
      "Universal bound ω(n) ≤ 2·π^(n/2)/(n/2)! avoids needing to combine even/odd limit arguments",
      "Composition: n/2 → ∞ (tendsto_atTop_atTop_of_monotone) + π^k/k! → 0 → squeeze to 0",
      "Key Mathlib lemma: summable_pow_div_factorial gives tendsto directly from Summable.tendsto_atTop_zero"
    ],
    "mathlibGaps": [],
    "nextSteps": [
      "Rate of decay: ω_n ~ √(2π/n)·(2πe/n)^{n/2} from Stirling — would require Stirling in Mathlib"
    ]
  },
